reagent-name-ipc-oil = ipc oil
reagent-desc-ipc-oil = the unintended mixing of an ipcs cooland and lubricant.

reagent-name-xenonid-blood = xenonid blood
reagent-desc-xenonid-blood = The highly corrosive blood of a xenonid, capable of eating straight through the hull of a station.

reagent-name-xenonid-blood-weak = weak xenonid blood
reagent-desc-xenonid-blood-weak = A weaker type of xenonid blood, found often in smaller or underdeveloped xenos, and very rarely in the fully grown. Not strong enough to eat through station hull plating, but its effects on organic matter are every bit as nasty as the strong stuff.
